---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "Privacy Policy for uDocumentView. We believe in zero-footprint viewing.",
  open_graph_type: "website"
};
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | uDocumentView" seo={seo}>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-slate">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: [NEEDS CONFIRMATION - Date]</p>

    <h2>Zero Footprint Guarantee</h2>
    <p>Our core philosophy is that we do not want your data. uDocumentView is designed to process documents locally in your browser whenever technically feasible. When server-side processing is necessary, it is done in memory (RAM) and the data is immediately discarded after rendering. We do not write your documents to disk.</p>

    <h2>Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We do not store the contents of your documents.</li>
      <li>We do not log the filenames of your documents.</li>
      <li>We do not require account creation, so we have no user profiles.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Analytics and Telemetry</h2>
    <p>We use minimal, privacy-respecting telemetry to monitor server health and application errors. We respect Do Not Track (DNT) and Global Privacy Control (GPC) signals.</p>

    <h2>Forms</h2>
    <p>Information submitted via our contact or newsletter forms is securely captured for the explicit purpose of responding to your inquiry or sending updates you requested.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
